msgstr "Conserver la lecture fournie : gmeow:ArcCountClockConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:arcCountTimeProperty ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArcSpecificNextRecordConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "specific breakthrough next record"
msgstr "prochain enregistrement de percée spécifique"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArcSpecificNextRecordConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An arc classified as insight, decision or settled-question breakthrough retains its exact arcNextRecord. A narrower label alone is not next-step evidence."
msgstr "Un arc classé comme percée par prise de conscience, décision ou question réglée conserve son arcNextRecord exact. Une étiquette plus précise seule ne constitue pas une preuve."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArcSpecificNextRecordConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This consistency law does not execute a teller, matcher, review or aggregate count."
